<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD AT LUNCH FOR NZ VS ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD AT LUNCH FOR NZ VS ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at lunch on day two</p>
